{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53222","headline":"诗偈 四十七 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 四十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"识乐衆生乐，缘绳枉（《宗镜录》卷四十作「妄」）走作。\n智乐菩萨乐，无绳亦无缚。\n若有发心者，直须学无作。\n莫道怕落空，得空亦不恶。\n见鑛不别（《宗镜录》作「识」）金，入鑛（《宗镜录》作「炉」）方知错。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53222.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53222","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}